(15, 'logo_path', 'settings/fmYtvyrC0mR92Sq9jIMTG1n5yxxOGHgDRY8LKCYt.webp', 'text', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-11 00:50:37', '2026-03-17 06:55:22'),
(16, 'tours_listing_intro', '<h2 class=\"mb-4\">The Best East Africa\'s Tours and Safaris</h2>\r\n<p>Welcome to Afro-Vertex Tours &amp; Safaris &mdash; your gateway to unforgettable journeys across Tanzania, Kenya, Uganda, Rwanda, and beyond. Whether you\'re dreaming of the Great Migration in Serengeti, summiting Kilimanjaro, relaxing on Zanzibar\'s white-sand beaches, or trekking to see mountain gorillas in Bwindi, we have the perfect safari, climb, or beach escape waiting for you.</p>\r\n<h2 class=\"mb-4\">Why Choose Afro Africa Tours</h2>\r\n<p>An African safari is a journey of a lifetime. Choosing to arrange your private adventure with Tanzania experts means that every step of the trip is as memorable as it should be.</p>\r\n<h3>Private safaris</h3>\r\n<p>We offer customized private safaris. This means that you can explore the country at your own pace, exactly the way you want! A private safari offers enormous flexibility to have your private vehicle and guide. You decide where to go, when and how long. If you prefer to watch lions at a waterhole for an hour, start your safari day very early and relax at the lodge in the afternoon. Want to spend the entire day in the bush? Go ahead. It&rsquo;s your adventure.</p>\r\n<h3>Personal advice from experts</h3>\r\n<p>As a local tour operator based in Arusha, Tanzania, we arrange and control the entire journey from A to Z. Our team is made up of a wealth of nationalities, including local Tanzanians who know the country and culture. Our professional&nbsp;<a href=\"https://tanzania-specialist.com/tanzania-travel/\">Tanzania travel</a>&nbsp;consultants are experts in Tanzania Safaris,&nbsp;<a href=\"https://tanzania-specialist.com/climbing-kilimanjaro/\">climbing Kilimanjaro</a>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<a href=\"https://tanzania-specialist.com/zanzibar-holiday/\">Zanzibar holidays</a>. From the planning of your luxury Tanzania safari to the last day of your journey, we are there for you. From advice on accommodation to the best places to visit in Tanzania, planning of the game drives. We&rsquo;ve got you covered.</p>\r\n<h3>Own guides and vehicles</h3>\r\n<p>A good safari guide can make or break your safari experience. We select our Tanzania safari guides based on experience, professionalism and expertise. Only 10% of the candidates pass our selection procedures, ensuring all our guides are highly trained and experienced. They are born and raised in Tanzania and can show you Tanzania through the eyes of its people who know every corner of this land. You will also enjoy a private 4WD safari vehicle throughout your trip in Tanzania. These robust vehicles are tailor-made for the wild landscapes of the bush. Our safari vehicles are all well maintained and offer excellent viewing opportunities from the extra-large windows and pop-up roofs.</p>\r\n<p>Our clients agree that a tailor-made safari with Tanzania Specialist is a once-in-a-lifetime vacation. Read more about what our customers have to say on their travel experience with Afro Africa Tours.</p>', 'textarea', 'tours_listing', 'Intro Paragraph (appears above filters)', 'Main welcome text shown at the top of the /tours page', '2026-03-16 02:51:21', '2026-07-01 07:22:31'),
(17, 'tours_listing_sections', '[{\"title\":\"Accommodation during your stay\",\"content\":\"<p>During your Tanzania safari, you will stay in beautiful lodges with full board. Each of the lodges is routinely examined by our local Afro africa staff members to ensure optimum quality every time. Our accommodation is often located in the midst of Tanzania&rsquo;s best national parks. Expect beautiful views and wildlife from your private veranda. Hear the sounds of lions roaring and elephants trumpeting, all from the comfort of your luxury lodge in Africa.<\\/p>\",\"image_side\":\"left\",\"image\":\"public\\/images\\/tours\\/section-0-1773657128.webp\"},{\"title\":\"The ultimate Tanzania Safari experience\",\"content\":\"<p>Picture a cheetah on the hunt, hundreds of thousands of hoofs thundering across the Serengeti plains, elephants bathing in the river and endless blue skies. This is Tanzania: the best safari country in Africa. If you want to embark on an authentic African safari, Tanzania offers it all: a unique mix of wildlife, landscapes and captivating cultures. National parks and game reserves cover almost 35% of the country, including Africa&rsquo;s most famous park Serengeti. Three out of the seven natural wonders of Africa are also found in Tanzania. Amongst them is Mount Kilimanjaro, Ngorongoro Crater and the Great Wildebeest Migration &ndash; the largest overland migration on the planet. With all this on offer, if there is one country where you can experience the ultimate safari, it is Tanzania.<\\/p>\",\"image_side\":\"right\",\"image\":\"public\\/images\\/tours\\/section-2-1773656868.webp\"},{\"title\":\"What is a safari?\",\"content\":\"<p>The word &lsquo;Safari&rsquo; is the Swahili word meaning &lsquo;long journey&rsquo;. During a safari, people travel through the bush or jungle to discover beautiful nature and wildlife. Nowadays, a safari is known as a journey through African countries while visiting one or more nature parks. Safari drives in the parks, looking for wildlife, are also called &lsquo;game drives&rsquo;.<\\/p>\",\"image_side\":\"left\",\"image\":\"public\\/images\\/tours\\/section-3-1773657865.webp\"}]', 'json', 'tours_listing', 'Extra Sections (below listings)', 'JSON array of sections with image, title, content, and image_side (left/right)', '2026-03-16 02:51:21', '2026-03-16 04:44:25'),
(18, 'hero_image_id', '616', 'text', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-07-01 07:23:14', '2026-07-01 07:23:14'),
(19, 'hero_title', 'Afro-Vertex Tours & Safaris: Best Tour Operator in Tanzania | Best Africa Tours Organizers for 2026', 'text', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-07-01 07:23:14', '2026-07-01 07:23:14'),
(20, 'hero_subtitle', 'Afro-Vertex Africa Tanzania Safari LTD is the best local tour operator in Tanzania, proudly headquartered in Moshi – Kilimanjaro with branches across all major regions including Arusha, Zanzibar, Mwanza, Mto wa Mbu / Lake Manyara, Karatu, Dodoma, Morogoro, Dar es Salaam and beyond.', 'text', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-07-01 07:23:14', '2026-07-01 07:23:14'),
(21, 'support_points', 'Personalized Itineraries,Expert Guides,24/7 Support', 'text', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-07-01 07:23:14', '2026-07-01 07:30:31'),
(22, 'our_story_image_id', '615', 'text', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-07-01 07:23:14', '2026-07-01 07:30:31'),
(23, 'our_story_title', 'About Us – Afro-Vertex Tours & Safaris', 'text', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-07-01 07:23:14', '2026-07-01 07:23:14'),
(24, 'our_story_content', '<p>Welcome to Afro-Vertex Africa Tanzania Safari LTD, where the Africa adventures meet the untamed beauty of nature!&nbsp;Afro-Vertex Africa Tanzania Safari LTD is&nbsp;a premier travel, tour, safari operator / company / Destination Management Company (DMC), agency&nbsp;headquartered in Tanzania, Africa dedicated to crafting immersive and unforgettable wildlife experiences and adventures across the Africa world most stunning safari and tour destinations.</p>', 'text', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-07-01 07:23:14', '2026-07-02 04:40:15'),
(25, 'get_to_know_image_id', '623', 'text', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-07-01 07:23:14', '2026-07-01 07:23:14'),
(26, 'get_to_know_title', 'Roam Through Our Africa Tours & Safari Tales', 'text', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-07-01 07:23:14', '2026-07-01 07:23:14'),
(27, 'get_to_know_content', '<p>At Afro-Vertex Tours &amp; Safaris, we believe Africa Tours &amp; safari is more than just a trip&mdash;it&rsquo;s a life-changing journey. It&rsquo;s about feeling the thrill of spotting a lion in its natural habitat, watching a herd of elephants march through the golden savanna, or waking up to the sound of exotic birds in a luxury tented camp. We take pride in making these moments possible for travelers who seek authentic, safe, and well-curated safari experiences.</p>', 'text', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-07-01 07:23:14', '2026-07-01 07:23:14'),
(28, 'cta_title', 'Your Tour in Africa , Our Passion!', 'text', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-07-01 07:23:14', '2026-07-01 07:23:14'),
(29, 'cta_subtitle', 'Planning the Africa Tours can be exciting, but we know you might have questions! Whether you’re curious about the best time to visit, what to pack, or which safari suits your style, our expert team is ready to guide you.', 'text', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-07-01 07:23:14', '2026-07-01 07:23:14'),
(30, 'cta_button_text', 'CONTACT US NOW', 'text', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-07-01 07:23:14', '2026-07-01 07:23:14'),
(31, 'cta_button_link', '/avt/pages/contact', 'text', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-07-01 07:23:14', '2026-07-01 07:34:38'),
(32, 'logo_image_id', NULL, 'text', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-07-01 07:23:14', '2026-07-01 07:23:14'),
(33, 'why_choose_us_cards', '[{\"icon\":\"isax isax-telescope\",\"title\":\"Expertly Curated Africa Tours & Safaris\",\"description\":\"Afro-Vertex Tours & Safaris focuses on wildlife conservation and sustainable travel. Join us in exploring nature responsibly!\"},{\"icon\":\"isax isax-telescope\",\"title\":\"Wildlife Like Never Before\",\"description\":\"Get up close with the Big Five, Gorillas, Great Wildebeests and explore untouched mountain landscapes. Experience the thrill of Africa Tours & safari like never before!\"},{\"icon\":\"isax isax-telescope\",\"title\":\"Local Safari Experts\",\"description\":\"Our knowledgeable local guides ensure that every adventure is both informative and thrilling, helping you connect with nature.\"},{\"icon\":\"\",\"title\":\"Luxury & Adventure Combined\",\"description\":\"Whether you prefer glamping beneath a blanket of stars, we have experiences to cater to your adventurous spirit.\"}]', 'text', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-07-01 07:23:14', '2026-07-01 07:30:31'),
